6.  CH-3 THE RESOLUTION CHANNEL -- if the kernel resolved INTERNAL accelerations
========================================================================================================

  If  m_I = sum_i m_i K(|a_i|/a0)  with |a_i| the CONSTITUENT accelerations, then the body's MI
  deformation is  1 - K_body = (a0/2) <1/|a_i|>  instead of  a0/(2 g_bar).  Representative |a_i|:
       nucleons in nuclei  ~ 3.83e+29 m/s^2   (8 MeV over 2 fm)
       electrons in atoms  ~ 4.52e+22 m/s^2   (13.6 eV over a_Bohr)
       lattice phonons     ~ 1.00e+15 m/s^2   (Debye omega^2 A)
  Mass is carried by nucleons, so <1/|a_i|> ~ 1/3.8e+29:

    canon  1-K_body(constituent-wise) = 1.222e-40   vs the 0.5 needed at a galaxy  ->  MOND suppressed by 4.09e+39x = 39.6 ORDERS
           its composition-dependent part (Pt vs Ti internal accel differ by O(30%)): eta ~ 3.67e-41  vs MICROSCOPE 2.3e-15  ->  6.3e+25x BELOW
    alt    1-K_body(constituent-wise) = 1.477e-40   vs the 0.5 needed at a galaxy  ->  MOND suppressed by 3.39e+39x = 39.5 ORDERS
           its composition-dependent part (Pt vs Ti internal accel differ by O(30%)): eta ~ 4.43e-41  vs MICROSCOPE 2.3e-15  ->  5.2e+25x BELOW

  TWO CONCLUSIONS, both load-bearing for (a):
   1. The constituent-wise reading is RAR-FATAL: it destroys the framework's galactic phenomenology by
      ~40 orders (every galaxy is made of atoms).  The framework is therefore FORCED to the
      centre-of-mass reading -- which is exactly the species-blind one.  eta = 0 is CO-FORCED with the
      RAR; it is not an extra assumption.  That is the strongest form of the structural argument, and
      it is an internal-consistency argument the paper does not currently make.
   2. Even if one granted CH-3, its composition-dependent eta is ~4e-41 -- 26 orders BELOW
      MICROSCOPE.  So the one channel that would genuinely carry internal structure is unobservable
      by WEP tests anyway: it dies on rotation curves, ~40 orders before MICROSCOPE gets a vote.

   [PASS] CH-3 (constituent-wise kernel) is excluded by the RAR itself, by >30 orders
   [PASS] CH-3's composition-dependent eta is >20 orders below MICROSCOPE

